          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.mx.com/authorization_code",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Clients use this endpoint to request an authorization code according to the parameters specified in the scope. Clients then pass this code to processors. Processor access is scoped only to the GUIDs and features specified in this request. Before requesting an authorization code which includes a member in the scope, clients must have verified that member."
